  <!-- EN: OCC Dominator -->
  <OE_Mech_OCC_Dominator.label>OCC统治者</OE_Mech_OCC_Dominator.label>
  <!-- EN: A medium-sized heavy armored combat mechanoid. The Dominator series is a modern combat mechanoid designed to sow death and destruction on the battlefield.\n\nThis model with additionally installed Vanguard program and uses reconstructed OCC Drill. -->
  <OE_Mech_OCC_Dominator.description>一种中等体型重装甲战斗机械体。统治者系列是现代战斗机械体，旨在在战场上散布死亡和毁灭。\n\n该型号额外安装了先锋程序，使用重构的OCC钻头。</OE_Mech_OCC_Dominator.description>
  <!-- EN: left fist -->
  <OE_Mech_OCC_Dominator.tools.left_fist.label>左拳</OE_Mech_OCC_Dominator.tools.left_fist.label>
  <!-- EN: right fist -->
  <OE_Mech_OCC_Dominator.tools.right_fist.label>右拳</OE_Mech_OCC_Dominator.tools.right_fist.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <OE_Mech_OCC_Dominator.tools.head.label>头部</OE_Mech_OCC_Dominator.tools.head.label>
  
